    "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
    "description": "State of [`DeadLetters`]: the dead letters by failed message id. The map's key order carries no meaning: a store may\nnot keep it (PostgreSQL's `jsonb` sorts object keys), so age is judged by [`DeadLetter::failed_at`] alone.",
